1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:58,520 --> 00:01:59,730
Another Soul Transformation ?

25
00:01:59,780 --> 00:02:01,150
Junior Ceng Niu,

26
00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:04,010
As I told you,

27
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:05,550
today

28
00:02:06,150 --> 00:02:07,810
is the day you die.

29
00:02:28,420 --> 00:02:29,810
My spiritual energy is in chaos

30
00:02:29,820 --> 00:02:31,250
and my Origin Soul is damaged.

31
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:33,350
Even when using the celestial sword

32
00:02:33,380 --> 00:02:36,080
I am not as strong as when I fought Red Butterfly.

33
00:02:37,950 --> 00:02:40,770
This Heaven-Sealing Formation is extremely complex,

34
00:02:40,820 --> 00:02:42,950
it must be some kind of ancient inheritance.

35
00:02:42,980 --> 00:02:44,850
I can't escape it in a short time.

36
00:02:51,220 --> 00:02:52,050
Master, run !

37
00:03:10,620 --> 00:03:12,850
This truly is a fine sword.

38
00:03:13,580 --> 00:03:15,810
It even contains a Sword Spirit !

39
00:03:16,320 --> 00:03:17,400
Good.

40
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:23,050
This sword can be yours

41
00:03:23,820 --> 00:03:26,650
but the flag that can summon tribulations

42
00:03:27,180 --> 00:03:28,520
belongs to me.

43
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,050
Fine,

44
00:03:31,620 --> 00:03:34,250
but I am taking back the star compass

45
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:36,180
that belonged to my clan.

46
00:03:36,620 --> 00:03:37,410
Of course.

47
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:44,210
Giant Demon Clan ?

48
00:03:47,750 --> 00:03:50,650
Giant Demon Clan Ancestor\NEarly stage Soul Transformation

49
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:50,360
This old man is indeed from the Giant Demon Clan.

50
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:52,250
Back in the Celestial Realm,

51
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:56,010
you stole the star compass from our young master, Chi Hu.

52
00:03:56,420 --> 00:03:57,210
But today

53
00:03:57,620 --> 00:03:58,810
I will take it back !

54
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:03,740
Two Soul Transformation old monsters joining hands

55
00:04:03,820 --> 00:04:05,710
just to take my life...

56
00:04:07,820 --> 00:04:09,050
It's an honor,

57
00:04:09,850 --> 00:04:12,150
I will be sure to remember it.

58
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,750
Indeed,

59
00:04:16,420 --> 00:04:18,610
you should remember it well.

60
00:04:19,080 --> 00:04:19,920
However,

61
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:22,810
you will leave your artifacts behind !

62
00:04:33,180 --> 00:04:34,590
That's a good artifact !

63
00:04:42,580 --> 00:04:43,980
I'm out of spiritual energy...

64
00:05:11,420 --> 00:05:12,110
Wait !

65
00:05:14,980 --> 00:05:15,680
Ancestor,

66
00:05:15,820 --> 00:05:17,150
please let this Junior

67
00:05:17,250 --> 00:05:18,380
kill this person

68
00:05:18,620 --> 00:05:20,080
to avenge myself.

69
00:05:27,020 --> 00:05:28,110
Chi Hu...

70
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:30,110
Ceng Niu,

71
00:05:30,420 --> 00:05:31,310
accept your death !

72
00:05:33,350 --> 00:05:34,210
Spiritual energy ?

73
00:05:34,580 --> 00:05:35,150
Brother Ceng,

74
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:37,080
escape to the southeast !

75
00:05:38,820 --> 00:05:39,610
Chi Hu,

76
00:05:39,820 --> 00:05:40,550
what are you doing !?

77
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,410
Go, now !

78
00:05:46,550 --> 00:05:47,180
Ancestor,

79
00:05:47,410 --> 00:05:49,470
the star compass is something I gifted to Ceng Niu,

80
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:50,510
not something he stole.

81
00:05:50,620 --> 00:05:52,950
Ceng Niu saved my life many times in the Celestial Realm.

82
00:05:52,980 --> 00:05:54,610
I, Chi Hu, am a man of my word.

83
00:05:54,620 --> 00:05:56,650
How could I abandon him just like that ?

84
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,250
Step aside !

85
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:02,810
The star compass is useless to our clan.

86
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:04,770
So what if I give it to Ceng Niu ?

87
00:06:04,820 --> 00:06:06,950
You took his flying sword, isn’t that enough ?

88
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:12,750
If you weren’t the junior with the purest Giant Demon blood,

89
00:06:13,620 --> 00:06:16,480
I would kill you today, you ungrateful brat !

90
00:06:17,150 --> 00:06:18,310
Once we return,

91
00:06:18,950 --> 00:06:21,230
you will be punished to 100 years

92
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:23,850
of constant pain from body refinement !

93
00:06:25,420 --> 00:06:27,550
I, Chi Hu, am an honorable man

94
00:06:27,980 --> 00:06:29,810
so I can’t do something so heartless.

95
00:06:30,950 --> 00:06:31,750
Brother Ceng,

96
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:33,710
I...

97
00:06:34,580 --> 00:06:35,520
tried my best...

98
00:06:36,880 --> 00:06:38,350
This formation is mysterious,

99
00:06:38,780 --> 00:06:40,650
it's even able to prevent me from entering

100
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,650
the Heaven Defying Bead.

101
00:06:42,220 --> 00:06:43,400
In the southeast

102
00:06:43,450 --> 00:06:45,070
there's a forest

103
00:06:45,100 --> 00:06:46,910
rich in Yin energy.

104
00:06:47,850 --> 00:06:48,650
Indeed,

105
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:50,490
if I can escape the formation there,

106
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:52,150
I can flee into a spatial rift.

107
00:06:54,150 --> 00:06:55,210
Junior,

108
00:06:55,580 --> 00:06:57,110
before a Soul Transformation cultivator,

109
00:06:57,620 --> 00:06:59,550
a mere Soul Formation cultivator

110
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:01,050
cannot survive.

111
00:06:59,890 --> 00:07:01,960
Li Yuanfeng's\NTea Domain

112
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:03,950
A Soul Transformation domain ?

113
00:07:04,030 --> 00:07:06,120
This is my Tea Domain.

114
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:08,110
The fragrance of tea

115
00:07:09,380 --> 00:07:12,200
allows me to savor the flavors of Life.

116
00:07:13,550 --> 00:07:15,710
The pot hides a universe

117
00:07:16,650 --> 00:07:19,460
and the leaves represent Spring and Autumn.

118
00:07:18,780 --> 00:07:20,200
Life and Death Domain,

119
00:07:20,220 --> 00:07:20,780
activate !

120
00:07:23,050 --> 00:07:24,710
With tea as my companion

121
00:07:25,950 --> 00:07:29,150
I grasped the meaning of Life.

122
00:07:42,980 --> 00:07:46,380
Before the domain of a Soul Transformation cultivator,

123
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:48,400
your domain

124
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,080
is pathetic.

125
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:03,720
We’ve wasted enough time,

126
00:08:04,220 --> 00:08:05,410
after killing him

127
00:08:05,420 --> 00:08:06,950
I have other matters to attend to.

128
00:08:07,620 --> 00:08:08,580
Fellow cultivator Li,

129
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:09,920
make your move.

130
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:13,450
Since you refuse to act,

131
00:08:14,020 --> 00:08:16,810
does that mean you are afraid of Mount Suzaku ?

132
00:08:17,450 --> 00:08:18,380
Forget it,

133
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:21,110
since I initiated this

134
00:08:21,850 --> 00:08:23,610
I’ll take care of it myself.

135
00:08:34,220 --> 00:08:35,780
He's here at last...

136
00:08:37,020 --> 00:08:38,810
The Heaven-Sealing Formation ?

137
00:08:39,780 --> 00:08:43,050
If I didn’t already know this formation,

138
00:08:43,580 --> 00:08:45,210
it would’ve been really hard

139
00:08:45,450 --> 00:08:47,150
for me to enter.

140
00:08:47,780 --> 00:08:48,780
The Corpse Sect ?

141
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:52,520
Although they’re only Early stage Soul Transformation,

142
00:08:52,550 --> 00:08:56,050
it’s said that Giant Demons who reach Soul Transformation

143
00:08:56,420 --> 00:08:58,780
awaken their bloodline's power.

144
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:02,320
I'd prefer not to provoke them too much.

145
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:05,010
Ceng Niu,

146
00:09:05,380 --> 00:09:06,780
do you have nothing better to do

147
00:09:07,050 --> 00:09:08,720
than getting yourself into trouble ?

148
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:12,320
You two old fossils,

149
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:17,040
aren't you ashamed of bullying a Soul Formation junior ?

150
00:09:18,150 --> 00:09:19,980
I’m taking this person away.

151
00:09:23,380 --> 00:09:24,000
Fellow cultivator...

152
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:24,710
Scram !

153
00:09:25,420 --> 00:09:27,410
A mere Early stage Soul Transformation

154
00:09:27,750 --> 00:09:29,810
whose cultivation was forcibly raised

155
00:09:30,980 --> 00:09:31,980
is unworthy

156
00:09:31,980 --> 00:09:33,510
to speak to this old man.

157
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:34,710
I refuse,

158
00:09:35,250 --> 00:09:37,010
he must die.

159
00:09:37,450 --> 00:09:39,110
And his corpse

160
00:09:39,420 --> 00:09:40,950
belongs to me !

161
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:43,750
You’re not from the Corpse Sect,

162
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:45,680
what use do you have for a corpse ?

163
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:47,400
That's because...

164
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:50,810
When I arrived,

165
00:09:51,050 --> 00:09:53,050
Wang Lin was already dead.

166
00:09:53,650 --> 00:09:56,850
But a strand of his soul fled to the Foreign Battlefield.

167
00:09:57,850 --> 00:09:59,450
I pursued it

168
00:09:59,980 --> 00:10:01,750
but after decades of searching,

169
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:03,210
I gave up.

170
00:10:04,180 --> 00:10:04,960
I fear that

171
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:06,610
the Heaven Defying Bead is also...

172
00:10:07,620 --> 00:10:09,610
Is anyone else

173
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:12,520
aware of this matter ?

174
00:10:13,550 --> 00:10:14,550
Of course not,

175
00:10:14,850 --> 00:10:17,450
I’ve erased all witnesses’ memories.

176
00:10:17,820 --> 00:10:19,360
Only I and the Envoy

177
00:10:19,780 --> 00:10:22,110
sent to Zhao's Heaven's Tower

178
00:10:22,180 --> 00:10:23,120
know the truth.

179
00:10:25,220 --> 00:10:26,010
Good,

180
00:10:26,780 --> 00:10:27,650
very good...

181
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:38,780
A treasure wanted by even the Cultivation Alliance

182
00:10:39,420 --> 00:10:41,650
can’t just disappear like that !

183
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:47,210
If we offer the Heaven Defying Bead to the Cultivation Alliance,

184
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:51,380
we will be promoted to a rank 6 cultivation country

185
00:10:51,980 --> 00:10:53,980
and gifted our own cultivation planet !

186
00:10:54,580 --> 00:10:55,850
When that happens,

187
00:10:56,650 --> 00:10:59,160
my Giant Demon Clan

188
00:10:59,780 --> 00:11:02,760
will have the ability to have Ascendant level cultivators.

189
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:12,800
I searched for Wang Lin’s whereabouts for years.

190
00:11:13,420 --> 00:11:16,510
Only after Chi Hu returned from the Celestial Realm

191
00:11:17,020 --> 00:11:18,780
did I learn by coincidence

192
00:11:19,180 --> 00:11:22,110
that Ceng Niu was Wang Lin.

193
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:25,850
To prevent the country of Suzaku from interfering,

194
00:11:25,980 --> 00:11:27,610
I waited for the right moment.

195
00:11:28,450 --> 00:11:30,610
When Li Yuanfeng came to me,

196
00:11:31,350 --> 00:11:33,780
I used the star compass as an excuse

197
00:11:33,950 --> 00:11:36,110
to join him to kill Wang Lin.

198
00:11:37,350 --> 00:11:39,210
Even if Wang Lin dies,

199
00:11:39,950 --> 00:11:41,650
as long as I have his corpse,

200
00:11:42,220 --> 00:11:46,380
I can get my hand on the Heaven Defying Bead.

201
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:50,380
I have my own reasons.

202
00:11:57,250 --> 00:11:58,310
Scram !

203
00:12:01,150 --> 00:12:02,010
You dare ?!

204
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:03,690
Giant Axe

205
00:12:12,150 --> 00:12:15,280
Border of the\Ncountry of Pilu

206
00:12:18,790 --> 00:12:20,360
Sun Tai came to save me

207
00:12:20,980 --> 00:12:22,880
but he doesn't have good intentions.

208
00:12:23,450 --> 00:12:25,580
However, it was the only way to escape the formation.

209
00:12:26,250 --> 00:12:27,810
A thousand-year slave seal...

210
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:31,150
It's only been a few years and you caused such a disaster !

211
00:12:31,450 --> 00:12:34,650
This time, I’ll seal you completely

212
00:12:35,020 --> 00:12:37,250
so you won’t drag me down with you.

213
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:40,350
Seal !

214
00:12:53,520 --> 00:12:56,010
Do you really think I'm afraid to fight you ?!

215
00:13:08,920 --> 00:13:09,950
How ?!

216
00:13:10,420 --> 00:13:11,610
My cultivation...

217
00:13:10,250 --> 00:13:13,390
Wang Lin's avatar\N3rd layer of Qi Condensation

218
00:13:12,620 --> 00:13:13,950
How did this happen ?

219
00:13:14,680 --> 00:13:16,210
Li Yuanfeng’s Tea Domain

220
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:17,950
and Sun Tai’s sealing mark

221
00:13:18,450 --> 00:13:21,280
must have combined into a powerful restriction

222
00:13:21,350 --> 00:13:23,550
that's draining my spiritual energy completely.

223
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:25,750
If this goes on,

224
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:28,880
I’ll revert into a powerless mortal.

225
00:13:31,350 --> 00:13:33,890
The last time I was this badly injured

226
00:13:34,050 --> 00:13:36,210
was when Teng Huayuan destroyed my body.

227
00:13:38,350 --> 00:13:41,190
Who would have thought that centuries later,

228
00:13:41,620 --> 00:13:43,710
I would encounter such a disaster again.

229
00:13:43,980 --> 00:13:46,250
I’ve been cautious every step of the way

230
00:13:46,980 --> 00:13:50,160
but still ended up at the mercy of others.

231
00:13:51,450 --> 00:13:52,410
Ceng Niu

232
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:53,910
is mine !

233
00:14:15,760 --> 00:14:17,290
Explode !

234
00:14:23,250 --> 00:14:26,260
When Soul Transformation cultivators fight for real,

235
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:28,000
it’s a battle of life and death.

236
00:14:28,920 --> 00:14:30,680
Are you ready ?

237
00:14:33,180 --> 00:14:36,180
Fighting a Middle stage Soul Transformation is exhausting

238
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:39,920
but Wang Lin is crucial to the Giant Demon Clan.

239
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:41,980
In that case,

240
00:14:42,750 --> 00:14:44,210
I have no choice.

241
00:14:46,420 --> 00:14:47,960
Now that it’s come to this

242
00:14:48,320 --> 00:14:50,180
you’ve forced my hand !

243
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:02,580
Soul Transformation cultivators rarely fight to the death.

244
00:15:03,580 --> 00:15:06,150
Once our celestial spiritual energy is depleted,

245
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:08,380
it cannot be replenished.

246
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:12,600
But since you insist,

247
00:15:12,950 --> 00:15:14,650
this old man will face you

248
00:15:15,050 --> 00:15:16,980
with celestial spiritual energy !

249
00:15:19,450 --> 00:15:21,010
The might of celestial spiritual energy

250
00:15:21,050 --> 00:15:23,160
is exclusive to Soul Transformation and above.

251
00:15:23,450 --> 00:15:26,440
I will never let the chance

252
00:15:26,920 --> 00:15:29,600
to revive my clan slip away !

253
00:15:37,820 --> 00:15:39,810
This old man is Middle stage Soul Transformation.

254
00:15:40,050 --> 00:15:42,350
Even with your Giant Demon Clan’s bloodline,

255
00:15:42,720 --> 00:15:44,780
you cannot bridge the gap between us.

256
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:48,320
Still refusing to yield ?

257
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:50,510
My Lightning Domain

258
00:15:50,650 --> 00:15:53,290
was gained after I paid a great price

259
00:15:53,580 --> 00:15:57,480
to cultivate a century on the Heavenly Thunder Planet !

260
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:56,160
Sun Tai's\NThunder Domain

261
00:15:57,580 --> 00:15:59,960
You mere Early stage Soul Transformation,

262
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:01,720
will die now !

263
00:16:12,750 --> 00:16:14,560
I’ll take this person away.

264
00:16:14,850 --> 00:16:17,000
and return him in 7 days.

265
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:17,890
Not possible !

266
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:19,840
If I let you take him,

267
00:16:20,050 --> 00:16:22,980
it's the same as giving you my Origin Soul.

268
00:16:35,820 --> 00:16:38,010
You dare to sneak up on him under my nose !?

269
00:16:39,250 --> 00:16:41,960
The seal on this kid is only half-complete.

270
00:16:42,750 --> 00:16:45,980
I must finish off these two quickly

271
00:16:46,620 --> 00:16:47,520
or else

272
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:49,840
something might go wrong.

273
00:16:50,550 --> 00:16:52,810
Since reaching Soul Transformation,

274
00:16:53,580 --> 00:16:57,010
this is my first time using my bloodline's power.

275
00:16:58,180 --> 00:16:59,180
You...

276
00:16:59,780 --> 00:17:01,560
take my attack !

277
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:03,280
Turn !

278
00:17:08,250 --> 00:17:09,380
Demon Child,

279
00:17:09,450 --> 00:17:10,250
come out !

280
00:17:14,620 --> 00:17:16,720
Demon Child\NMiddle stage Soul Transformation

281
00:17:16,650 --> 00:17:17,580
Turn !

282
00:17:17,980 --> 00:17:18,810
Demon Child,

283
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:19,750
kill him !

284
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:23,110
Turn !

285
00:17:41,890 --> 00:17:44,210
With my Early stage Soul Transformation cultivation,

286
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:47,160
my bloodline's power has no attack power.

287
00:17:47,600 --> 00:17:50,880
It can only teleport the target to a distant planet.

288
00:18:05,620 --> 00:18:06,920
If I keep fighting,

289
00:18:07,620 --> 00:18:10,350
I'm afraid my soul will dissipate...

290
00:18:31,350 --> 00:18:32,780
I played all my cards

291
00:18:33,780 --> 00:18:36,050
but they didn't amount to anything.

292
00:18:36,850 --> 00:18:38,120
It was all in vain...

293
00:18:39,380 --> 00:18:41,150
My cultivation is still falling...

294
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:45,000
My spiritual energy is leaving my body...

295
00:18:47,220 --> 00:18:49,180
The path of cultivation

296
00:18:49,760 --> 00:18:51,250
truly is

297
00:18:51,620 --> 00:18:53,320
unpredictable.

298
00:18:54,560 --> 00:18:55,650
In 8 years,

299
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:59,650
Wan’er will face the law of the heavens again.

300
00:19:02,320 --> 00:19:04,410
8 years...

301
00:19:28,120 --> 00:19:31,420
To let go of the consequences of my actions

302
00:19:31,420 --> 00:19:33,140
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

303
00:19:33,180 --> 00:19:35,080
like scattered ink.

304
00:19:35,960 --> 00:19:42,560
As destiny falls

305
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:42,560
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

306
00:19:42,560 --> 00:19:50,160
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

307
00:19:45,800 --> 00:19:50,160
wither and melt into rivers.

308
00:19:50,600 --> 00:19:57,720
Who can deceive

309
00:19:53,360 --> 00:19:57,720
the law of the heavens ?

310
00:19:58,040 --> 00:20:01,040
Countless generations

311
00:19:59,320 --> 00:20:01,040
have tried before me.

312
00:20:01,330 --> 00:20:04,760
But how could I not catch my dreams

313
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:04,760
within my warm fingers ?

314
00:20:05,320 --> 00:20:08,840
You're at my side when I'm alone

315
00:20:08,840 --> 00:20:12,160
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

316
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:16,120
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

317
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:20,320
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

318
00:20:18,320 --> 00:20:20,320
in the streets.

319
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:25,280
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

320
00:20:22,040 --> 00:20:25,280
Can I break the rules ?

321
00:20:25,290 --> 00:20:28,000
To run towards you !

322
00:20:28,040 --> 00:20:31,320
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

323
00:20:31,320 --> 00:20:35,960
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

324
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:39,360
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

325
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:44,040
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

326
00:20:44,490 --> 00:20:49,720
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

327
00:20:49,840 --> 00:20:53,640
If your soul is willing to wander,

328
00:20:53,640 --> 00:20:58,280
can I still take your hands

329
00:20:55,320 --> 00:20:58,280
and hold them tight ?

330
00:20:58,440 --> 00:21:01,360
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

331
00:21:01,360 --> 00:21:06,240
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

332
00:21:06,250 --> 00:21:09,520
I dream of destroying

333
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:14,240
the shackles of our fate.

334
00:21:14,240 --> 00:21:18,200
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

335
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:21,000
You're the hardest to let go of.

336
00:21:21,080 --> 00:21:24,880
I want to be with you again

337
00:21:24,960 --> 00:21:28,240
so I can look in your eyes.

338
00:21:28,520 --> 00:21:33,480
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
